flowchart TB
    N1["1. Entry domain: NeoVM bytecode | initial stack | syscall host callbacks"]
    N2["2. Normalization: shape bytecode, stack, gas, and syscall responses into canonical VM context"]
    N3["3. Core mechanism: Decode canonical opcodes | Execute stack and state semantics | Expose reusable runtime APIs"]
    N4["4. State and commitment: script hash, final stack digest, halt/fault status, and gas"]
    N5["5. Evidence or result: halt/fault result | final stack | gas/accounting evidence"]
    N6["6. Consumer boundary: neo-riscv-vm | neo-zkvm | Neo N4 execution core"]
    N7["7. Failure path: invalid opcode, stack mismatch, gas exhaustion, syscall rejection, or fault"]
    N8["8. Extension point: syscall host, gas policy, diagnostics, and compatibility profiles"]
    N1 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N1 --> N4
    N1 --> N5
    N1 --> N6
    N1 --> N7
    N1 --> N8
    N2 -. constrains .-> N4
    N4 -. produces .-> N5
    N5 -. consumed by .-> N6
